  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4dadd91b38f0d754e154b028c9bf24ff4c475ab6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"283\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pC8HxhTPK3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/vesmaybevesper/Pale-World-Effects/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fvesmaybevesper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpalegardenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/3fUX4yDd?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;color=276538\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"></a><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1208301?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"173\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個獨立模組，僅包含來自我的模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pale-world\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pale World</a> 的特效，因為有時候你只想玩更美觀的原版 Minecraft。</p><p><strong><em>目前功能：</em></strong></p><ul>\n<li>蒼白花園迷霧</li>\n<li>綻放的眼淚花能發出光源</li>\n</ul><h2>相容性：</h2><ul>\n<li>尚未與任何添加類似功能的模組進行測試</li>\n<li>使用 Iris 且啟用光影時，迷霧將不會渲染，但除此之外都能正常運作。</li>\n<li>與 Fog 模組相容，但由於我無法完全控制，顯示效果可能有所不同。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dc9280455e1c94978a408dde3d6785bce2a4503d_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"300\"></a></p>",
